WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Nature and Mission of MFSS in a Business Environment

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.933
Welcome to this session on Managing for Six Sigma.

3
00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:16.166
This is a very interesting topic because it ties directly with DFSS and PFSS.

4
00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:22.632
In fact, like three overlapping circles,

5
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:28.733
we have MFSS. And we’ll zoom in here on this.

6
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:35.599
Managing for Six Sigma. We have over here PFSS, Processing for Six Sigma.

7
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.600
And Design for Six Sigma.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.666
You see, it's Managing for Six Sigma

9
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:48.066
that creates a linkage between PFSS and DFSS.

10
00:00:48.066 --> 00:00:53.632
It's the bonding agent that brings the two together.

11
00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:56.633
That oversees the two

12
00:00:56.633 --> 00:01:02.999
Remember, management is the judicious use of control for the attainment of an end.

13
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.566
So, management uses control toward the attainment of an end. Six Sigma.

14
00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:13.066
Through the means of Processing for Six Sigma and Designing for Six Sigma.

15
00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:17.066
So, what do we mean when we say, Managing for Six Sigma?

16
00:01:17.066 --> 00:01:23.799
What we're really talking about there, is the whole experience of how to

17
00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:30.766
deploy Six Sigma. How to deploy resources.

18
00:01:30.766 --> 00:01:34.266
How to deploy people.

19
00:01:34.266 --> 00:01:38.666
How to deploy money, knowledge.

20
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:44.066
And then, and that's of course at the global level.

21
00:01:44.066 --> 00:01:47.566
As we move down toward the local level,

22
00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:52.299
we start to be concerned with implementation.

23
00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.300
How do we implement Six Sigma?

24
00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.300
And finally, at the activity level,

25
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:06.600
we start to look at how do we apply Six Sigma?

26
00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:13.166
Now, MFSS is about the

27
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.832
characterization and optimization

28
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:23.833
of the processes necessary to deploy, implement, and apply

29
00:02:23.833 --> 00:02:29.166
Processing for Six Sigma, tools and concepts,

30
00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:33.166
and Design for Six Sigma, tools and concepts.

31
00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:40.199
So in other words, it's kinda like how do we get the energy to the electric motor?

32
00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:46.733
Managing for Six Sigma is about distribution of that energy

33
00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:52.366
to make these two things happen. That's what it's all about.

34
00:02:52.366 --> 00:02:56.366
That is the essence of Managing for Six Sigma.

35
00:02:56.366 --> 00:03:01.366
Thank you for choosing SSMI.

